  "title": "Why Repowering Has Become a Major Growth Market",
  "summary": "Solar repowering is one of the fastest-growing opportunities in residential solar as millions of aging systems require upgrades and modernization. Homeowner expectations have evolved, driving demand for battery storage, advanced monitoring, inverter replacements, and system expansions. Repowering creates recurring business opportunities by helping homeowners improve existing solar systems instead of replacing them entirely. Tigo's flexible ecosystem enables installers to modernize aging solar systems with optimization, monitoring, inverters, battery storage, and scalable repowering solutions.",
